{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "packageId": "prompt-hubs-firefly",
  "authority": "seed",
  "notes": [
    "Prompt-Hubs Firefly Seedance2 家族（480p / 720p fast），按秒计费，所以档位自由（duration_choices 为 null）。",
    "固定夹带 resolution=480p，并且必须丢弃 seconds 字段 —— 这两条是这家上游的硬要求，不是偏好。",
    "与 kacang-933-fast 逐字段相同、只差命中规则；两者刻意保持成各自完整的条目，关系由测试里的「漂移守卫」钉住，而不是靠共享基类隐式继承。",
    "本包只描述「中性请求怎么落到这家上游」，中性请求模型仍在 Python 代码里。"
  ],
  "profiles": [
    {
      "profile_id": "prompt_hubs_firefly",
      "match_prefixes": [
        "firefly-seedance2",
        "firefly-seedance"
      ],
      "duration_field": "duration",
      "duration_choices": null,
      "ratio_field": "ratio",
      "first_frame_field": "image",
      "ref_field": "referenceImages",
      "audio_field": "generate_audio",
      "auto_face_field": "auto_face",
      "extra_static": {
        "resolution": "480p"
      },
      "drop_fields": [
        "seconds"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
